The native occurrence witness (native_occurrence.rs), the native laws (native_law.rs:
AthenaWalk/AthenaFuture), the athena_walk/athena_future kernels and their shape/record
functions, the OccurrenceWitness trait, and the permutations->arrays material rename — written
before the 2026-08-19 single-card pivot and quarantined by
blueprint/THE_SINGLE_CARD_PASSAGE_CARRIES_PHOENIX_AND_THE_MATHEMATICS_CODEC.md: "neither deleted
nor admitted; their source testimony may be rederived after Deed H5; their current execution shape
may not be extended." Kept on this side branch, off main, so main's gates read the admitted tree.
One-thread flat kernels and maximum-legal-block launch are the convicted substrate; the
architecture ratchet is red on this cone by construction and no ledger re-seed is authorized.

